日志中聚合的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 模式 (fact-4c0895a0de49) 与 DeepFlow/Tempo 追踪数据 (fact-1475da77a435) 相互印证，证明 500 错误源于应用业务层而非环境资源。\n2.  **K8s 状态反馈**：退出码 78 (fact-bc72c7f5e4e2) 配合 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态 (fact-965bfdd5a4fa) 证实了应用非被动 OOM 或被杀，而是内部主动崩溃退出。\n\n**未确认/信息不足**：\n缺失具体的配置项名称（如 ConfigMap/Secret 名称或字段名）或具体的挂载路径失败原因。当前证据仅能确定错误模式为“配置缺失”，无法直接定位到配置源的物理缺失或应用读取配置的逻辑错误。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 12.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 57.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 57.5s (Evidence 48.5s, RCA 8.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 85.853, "metrics": {"run_id": "f7df50336c0846eb", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 85.85743737220764, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "we